# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Persyaratan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compilation requires the following tools:\n"
"* A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, GCC on Linux and Clang on MacOS. Qiskit's C API is compatible with a compiler conforming to the [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)) standard.\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): a tool to create the C header, which you can install with `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"   Running the tool from the command line should be enabled, which might require exporting your `PATH` variable to include `/path/to/.cargo/bin`.\n"
"* Python library installed (Python 3.9+): The Python library is required during dynamic linking. Notice that Python is not used at runtime and the interpreter is never initialized; only some symbols from `libpython` need to be defined. See [this issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) for more details.\n"
"* (GNU) Make: this is optional but is recommended to use automated install processes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kompilasi membutuhkan alat-alat berikut:\n"
"* Compiler Rust: lihat misalnya [panduan menginstal Qiskit dari source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* Compiler C: misalnya, GCC di Linux dan Clang di MacOS. C API Qiskit kompatibel dengan compiler yang memenuhi standar [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)).\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): alat untuk membuat C header, yang bisa kamu instal dengan `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"   Menjalankan alat ini dari command line harus diaktifkan, yang mungkin memerlukan ekspor variabel `PATH` untuk menyertakan `/path/to/.cargo/bin`.\n"
"* Library Python terinstal (Python 3.9+): Library Python diperlukan selama dynamic linking. Perlu diperhatikan bahwa Python tidak digunakan saat runtime dan interpreter tidak pernah diinisialisasi; hanya beberapa simbol dari `libpython` yang perlu didefinisikan. Lihat [issue ini](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"
"* (GNU) Make: ini opsional tapi direkomendasikan untuk menggunakan proses instalasi otomatis.\n"

