msgid "This section provides build instructions for Windows systems.\n"
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan instruksi build untuk sistem Windows.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two independent ways to use the C API on Windows:\n"
msgstr "Ada dua cara independen untuk menggunakan C API di Windows:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Build Python extension modules** that use the Qiskit C API. Follow Steps 1-5. This path uses the C headers shipped with the `qiskit` Python package and does not require Rust or cbindgen.\n"
msgstr "**Bangun modul ekstensi Python** yang menggunakan Qiskit C API. Ikuti Langkah 1-5. Cara ini menggunakan header C yang disertakan dengan paket Python `qiskit` dan tidak memerlukan Rust atau cbindgen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Build the standalone C library** to link against from a pure C program, as is done in the [UNIX-like](#unix) section. Complete Step 1, then skip to [Build the standalone library](#build-the-standalone-library), which lists its additional requirements.\n"
msgstr "**Bangun library C standalone** untuk di-link dari program C murni, seperti yang dilakukan pada bagian [UNIX-like](#unix). Selesaikan Langkah 1, lalu lanjut ke [Build the standalone library](#build-the-standalone-library), yang mencantumkan persyaratan tambahannya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements-1}"
msgstr "Persyaratan {#requirements-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator rights are required for some steps.\n"
msgstr "Hak administrator diperlukan untuk beberapa langkah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "5-8 GB free disk space.\n"
msgstr "Ruang disk kosong 5-8 GB.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A C compiler: Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), installed in Step 1.\n"
msgstr "Kompiler C: Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), diinstal di Langkah 1.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 64-bit Python installation (3.10 or later), installed in Step 1.\n"
msgstr "Instalasi Python 64-bit (3.10 atau yang lebih baru), diinstal di Langkah 1.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum kamu mulai {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create your workspace.  This should be a short path on a local drive. Do not use OneDrive-synced folders (such as Documents or Desktop), network drives, or paths with spaces or non-ASCII characters. If your user name contains non-English characters, don't put it under your user folder.\n"
msgstr "Buat workspace kamu.  Ini sebaiknya berupa path pendek pada drive lokal. Jangan gunakan folder yang disinkronkan dengan OneDrive (seperti Documents atau Desktop), drive jaringan, atau path dengan spasi atau karakter non-ASCII. Jika nama pengguna kamu mengandung karakter non-Inggris, jangan letakkan di dalam folder pengguna kamu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of good workspace paths: `C:\\workspace`, `D:\\workspace`, `C:\\Users\\john\\workspace`\n"
msgstr "Contoh path workspace yang baik: `C:\\workspace`, `D:\\workspace`, `C:\\Users\\john\\workspace`\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1. Install the prerequisites {#step-1-install-the-prerequisites}"
msgstr "Langkah 1. Instal prasyarat {#step-1-install-the-prerequisites}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC Build Tools (C compiler) — install this first\">\n"
"This is a large download (2-5 GB, 10-30 min). Install it first so you know immediately whether your computer is compatible.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC Build Tools (Kompiler C) — instal ini terlebih dahulu\">\n"
"Ini adalah unduhan berukuran besar (2-5 GB, 10-30 menit). Instal ini terlebih dahulu agar kamu langsung tahu apakah komputermu kompatibel.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Requires administrator rights.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Option A — `winget`** \n"
"Open a PowerShell terminal and run the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Opsi A — `winget`** \n"
"Buka terminal PowerShell dan jalankan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The terminal appears frozen while the installer runs.  This is normal and will take 10-30 minutes. Check your taskbar for a \"Visual Studio Installer\" window.\n"
msgstr "Terminal akan terlihat seperti macet saat installer berjalan.  Ini normal dan akan memakan waktu 10-30 menit. Periksa taskbar kamu untuk jendela \"Visual Studio Installer\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `winget` is not recognized, update [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) from the Microsoft Store, or use Option B.\n"
msgstr "Jika `winget` tidak dikenali, perbarui [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) dari Microsoft Store, atau gunakan Opsi B.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Option B — manual download**\n"
"Open the [Visual Studio Build Tools for C++](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/) website and click Download Build Tools.  Run the executable to start the install.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Opsi B — unduhan manual**\n"
"Buka situs [Visual Studio Build Tools for C++](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/) dan klik Download Build Tools.  Jalankan file eksekusi untuk memulai instalasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the Installing Visual Studio window opens, on the Workloads tab, choose \"Desktop development with C++\". See the [Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170#step-4---choose-workloads) page for further details. \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Code\">\n"
"Download VS Code from the [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/) site, or run `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code`. Run the downloaded executable file to install VS Code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketika jendela Installing Visual Studio terbuka, pada tab Workloads, pilih \"Desktop development with C++\". Lihat halaman [Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170#step-4---choose-workloads) untuk detail lebih lanjut. \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Code\">\n"
"Unduh VS Code dari situs [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/), atau jalankan `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code`. Jalankan file eksekusi yang diunduh untuk menginstal VS Code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After it is installed, continue with these steps:\n"
"1. Open VS Code\n"
"2. Click File → Open Folder, then select your workspace (for example, `C:\\workspace`).\n"
"3. Click Terminal → New terminal to open a PowerShell terminal.\n"
"4. Click the Extensions icon on the left or press Ctrl+Shift+X. In the Extensions window, search for and install `ms-python.python`, `ms-toolsai.jupyter`, and `ms-vscode.cpptools`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah terinstal, lanjutkan dengan langkah berikut:\n"
"1. Buka VS Code\n"
"2. Klik File → Open Folder, lalu pilih workspace kamu (misalnya, `C:\\workspace`).\n"
"3. Klik Terminal → New terminal untuk membuka terminal PowerShell.\n"
"4. Klik ikon Extensions di sebelah kiri atau tekan Ctrl+Shift+X. Di jendela Extensions, cari dan instal `ms-python.python`, `ms-toolsai.jupyter`, dan `ms-vscode.cpptools`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the rest of the commands in this guide in the VS Code terminal, unless otherwise instructed. The VS Code terminal defaults to PowerShell, preventing mix-ups with the Windows built-in command window. \n"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah lainnya dalam panduan ini di terminal VS Code, kecuali diinstruksikan lain. Terminal VS Code menggunakan PowerShell secara default, sehingga mencegah kebingungan dengan command window bawaan Windows. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the workspace variable.  For example, if your workspace is called `workspace`, run the following:\n"
msgstr "Atur variabel workspace.  Misalnya, jika workspace kamu bernama `workspace`, jalankan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Python 3.12 (recommended version)\">\n"
"Python 3.12 is recommended because it has the best wheel availability for `qiskit-aer` and other dependencies. 3.10 and 3.11 also work, but 3.13 or later might lack pre-built wheels for some packages.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Python 3.12 (versi yang direkomendasikan)\">\n"
"Python 3.12 direkomendasikan karena memiliki ketersediaan wheel terbaik untuk `qiskit-aer` dan dependensi lainnya. 3.10 dan 3.11 juga berfungsi, tetapi 3.13 atau yang lebih baru mungkin tidak memiliki wheel pre-built untuk beberapa paket.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open the VS Code terminal and run the following code to detect a suitable version of Python:\n"
msgstr "Buka terminal VS Code dan jalankan kode berikut untuk mendeteksi versi Python yang sesuai:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the download didn't work, or you prefer manual download, comment out the code lines that install Python 3.12, then download Python 3.12 from the [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) website.  Run the executable to install Python.  Select \"Add Python to PATH\" during the install, then rerun the above snippet to make sure it's being found.\n"
msgstr "Jika unduhan tidak berhasil, atau kamu lebih suka mengunduh secara manual, beri komentar pada baris kode yang menginstal Python 3.12, lalu unduh Python 3.12 dari situs [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/).  Jalankan file eksekusi untuk menginstal Python.  Pilih \"Add Python to PATH\" selama instalasi, lalu jalankan ulang cuplikan kode di atas untuk memastikan Python terdeteksi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- Do NOT use the Microsoft Store Python because it lacks C headers. If `python` opens the Microsoft Store, disable the alias by going to Windows Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"- JANGAN gunakan Python dari Microsoft Store karena tidak memiliki header C. Jika `python` membuka Microsoft Store, nonaktifkan alias tersebut dengan membuka Windows Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Anaconda users: run `conda deactivate` until the (base) prefix disappears. If it won't go away, open a new terminal in VS Code.\n"
"</Admonition> \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Pengguna Anaconda: jalankan `conda deactivate` sampai prefix (base) menghilang. Jika tidak juga hilang, buka terminal baru di VS Code.\n"
"</Admonition> \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Git (optional)\">\n"
"    Only needed if you clone lab repositories.  Run `winget install Git.Git`.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Git (opsional)\">\n"
"    Hanya diperlukan jika kamu meng-clone repositori lab.  Jalankan `winget install Git.Git`.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""

