#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {#troubleshooting}"
msgstr "Pemecahan masalah {#troubleshooting}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`winget` is not recognized\">\n"
"Update the [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) from the Microsoft Store, or use the relevant manual download links\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`cl` is not recognized\">\n"
"Rerun the MSVC load cell (Step 3), or use the x64 Native Tools Command Prompt\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`python` opens Microsoft Store\">\n"
"Go to Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases and turn off `python.exe`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`.ps1 cannot be loaded` / scripts disabled\">\n"
"Run `Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned` then retry\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`cannot open file 'qiskit.h'`\">\n"
"Run `python -c \"import qiskit.capi; print(qiskit.capi.get_include())\"` and confirm the path exists\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`qiskit.capi` not found\">\n"
"Run `pip install \"qiskit[visualization]~=2.4.2\"`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`qiskit-aer` build fails\">\n"
"Run `pip install qiskit-aer --only-binary=:all:`. If that also fails, use Python 3.12 or skip aer, which is optional\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build runs but import fails with a version error\">\n"
"The built Qiskit C extension and the installed Qiskit version must have the same version.  Reinstall Qiskit with `pip install \"qiskit~=2.4.2\"`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"I rebuilt the C but the circuit did not change\">\n"
"A C extension cannot be re-imported live. Restart the kernel, rerun the MSVC commands (Step 3), then rebuild\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"PowerShell script was blocked\">\n"
"`Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Path length errors\">\n"
"Use a short root path on C:\\ (for example, `C:\\workspace`, or the path you set in the setup step), or enable Long Paths: Settings → System → For developers → Long Paths\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Conda is active (the prompt shows `(base)`) or builds behave oddly after using Anaconda\">\n"
"Run `conda deactivate` until `CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV` and `CONDA_PREFIX` are both gone from the environment. Check with `$env:CONDA_PREFIX`. If they persist, open a fresh PowerShell (not an Anaconda prompt) and retry from Step 2.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"The virtual environment was created from a conda-managed Python (check the `home =` line in `.venv\\pyvenv.cfg`)\">\n"
"The virtual environment inherited conda's C runtime and cannot be fixed in place. Delete it, download Python 3.12 from the [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) website, and rebuild. Run `Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .venv`, then rerun the Python detection snippet in Step 1 to set `$PYTHON_EXE`, then recreate the virtual environment (Step 2).\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`DLL load failed` on import\">\n"
"Conda is likely leaking into the virtual environment. Check both of the issues immediately above this. Also verify that Python is 64-bit: `python -c \"import platform; print(platform.architecture())\"`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build fails with garbled paths or `C1083`\">\n"
"Your username or workspace path contains non-ASCII characters. Move the workspace to a short ASCII-only path (for example, `C:\\workspace`)\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build or import randomly fails, works on retry\">\n"
"The workspace folder is synced by OneDrive. Move it to a local path like `C:\\workspace`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build interrupted midway (for example, there was a power loss)\">\n"
"Delete the `_smoke_pkg` folder in your workspace, rerun the MSVC load cell, then rerun the smoke test cell\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`pip install` fails with SSL certificate error\">\n"
"Your network uses a proxy that intercepts HTTPS. Try running `pip install --trusted-host pypi.org --trusted-host files.pythonhosted.org qiskit` or ask your network administrator for the proxy CA certificate\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Windows Defender quarantines the `.pyd` file\">\n"
"Add your workspace's `.venv` and `_smoke_pkg` folders to Defender exclusions by going to Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Manage settings → Exclusions\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Build Tools cannot be installed (no admin rights)\">\n"
"Administrator access is required. Ask your IT department for access\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`WinError 32` / file in use during rebuild\">\n"
"The .pyd is locked by the running kernel. Restart the kernel (Ctrl+Shift+P → Jupyter: Restart Kernel), rerun Step 3, then rebuild\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Commands silently do nothing (no error, no output)\">\n"
"You might be in cmd.exe instead of PowerShell. Check your prompt: PowerShell shows `PS C:\\>`, cmd shows `C:\\>`. Open PowerShell from Start Menu or Win+X\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC install appears stuck\">\n"
"The `--passive --wait` flags block PowerShell while the installer runs in the background. Check your taskbar for a \"Visual Studio Installer\" window. It can take 10-30 minutes to install\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`winget` tidak dikenali\">\n"
"Perbarui [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) dari Microsoft Store, atau gunakan link unduhan manual yang relevan\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`cl` tidak dikenali\">\n"
"Jalankan ulang cell pemuatan MSVC (Langkah 3), atau gunakan x64 Native Tools Command Prompt\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`python` membuka Microsoft Store\">\n"
"Buka Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases dan matikan `python.exe`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`.ps1 cannot be loaded` / skrip dinonaktifkan\">\n"
"Jalankan `Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned` lalu coba lagi\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`cannot open file 'qiskit.h'`\">\n"
"Jalankan `python -c \"import qiskit.capi; print(qiskit.capi.get_include())\"` dan pastikan path-nya ada\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`qiskit.capi` tidak ditemukan\">\n"
"Jalankan `pip install \"qiskit[visualization]~=2.4.2\"`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build `qiskit-aer` gagal\">\n"
"Jalankan `pip install qiskit-aer --only-binary=:all:`. Jika itu juga gagal, gunakan Python 3.12 atau lewati aer, yang bersifat opsional\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build berhasil tapi impor gagal dengan error versi\">\n"
"Ekstensi C Qiskit yang dibangun dan versi Qiskit yang terinstal harus memiliki versi yang sama.  Instal ulang Qiskit dengan `pip install \"qiskit~=2.4.2\"`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Saya membangun ulang C tapi circuit tidak berubah\">\n"
"Ekstensi C tidak bisa diimpor ulang secara langsung. Restart kernel, jalankan ulang perintah MSVC (Langkah 3), lalu bangun ulang\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Skrip PowerShell diblokir\">\n"
"`Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Error panjang path\">\n"
"Gunakan path root pendek di C:\\ (misalnya, `C:\\workspace`, atau path yang kamu tetapkan di langkah setup), atau aktifkan Long Paths: Settings → System → For developers → Long Paths\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Conda aktif (prompt menampilkan `(base)`) atau build berperilaku aneh setelah menggunakan Anaconda\">\n"
"Jalankan `conda deactivate` sampai `CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV` dan `CONDA_PREFIX` keduanya hilang dari environment. Periksa dengan `$env:CONDA_PREFIX`. Jika masih ada, buka PowerShell baru (bukan prompt Anaconda) dan coba lagi dari Langkah 2.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Virtual environment dibuat dari Python yang dikelola conda (periksa baris `home =` di `.venv\\pyvenv.cfg`)\">\n"
"Virtual environment ini mewarisi C runtime dari conda dan tidak bisa diperbaiki di tempat. Hapus, unduh Python 3.12 dari website [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/), dan bangun ulang. Jalankan `Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .venv`, lalu jalankan ulang snippet deteksi Python di Langkah 1 untuk menetapkan `$PYTHON_EXE`, lalu buat ulang virtual environment (Langkah 2).\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`DLL load failed` saat impor\">\n"
"Conda kemungkinan bocor ke virtual environment. Periksa kedua masalah tepat di atas ini. Pastikan juga Python berupa 64-bit: `python -c \"import platform; print(platform.architecture())\"`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build gagal dengan path yang kacau atau `C1083`\">\n"
"Nama pengguna atau path workspace kamu mengandung karakter non-ASCII. Pindahkan workspace ke path pendek yang hanya berisi ASCII (misalnya, `C:\\workspace`)\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build atau impor gagal secara acak, berhasil saat dicoba ulang\">\n"
"Folder workspace disinkronkan oleh OneDrive. Pindahkan ke path lokal seperti `C:\\workspace`\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Build terganggu di tengah jalan (misalnya, ada pemadaman listrik)\">\n"
"Hapus folder `_smoke_pkg` di workspace kamu, jalankan ulang cell pemuatan MSVC, lalu jalankan ulang cell smoke test\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`pip install` gagal dengan error sertifikat SSL\">\n"
"Jaringan kamu menggunakan proxy yang mencegat HTTPS. Coba jalankan `pip install --trusted-host pypi.org --trusted-host files.pythonhosted.org qiskit` atau minta sertifikat CA proxy dari administrator jaringan kamu\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Windows Defender mengkarantina file `.pyd`\">\n"
"Tambahkan folder `.venv` dan `_smoke_pkg` workspace kamu ke pengecualian Defender dengan membuka Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Manage settings → Exclusions\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Build Tools tidak bisa diinstal (tidak ada hak admin)\">\n"
"Akses administrator diperlukan. Minta akses dari departemen IT kamu\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`WinError 32` / file sedang digunakan saat build ulang\">\n"
"File .pyd terkunci oleh kernel yang sedang berjalan. Restart kernel (Ctrl+Shift+P → Jupyter: Restart Kernel), jalankan ulang Langkah 3, lalu bangun ulang\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Perintah diam-diam tidak melakukan apa pun (tidak ada error, tidak ada output)\">\n"
"Kamu mungkin berada di cmd.exe, bukan PowerShell. Periksa prompt kamu: PowerShell menampilkan `PS C:\\>`, cmd menampilkan `C:\\>`. Buka PowerShell dari Start Menu atau Win+X\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Instalasi MSVC tampak macet\">\n"
"Flag `--passive --wait` memblokir PowerShell selagi installer berjalan di latar belakang. Periksa taskbar kamu untuk jendela \"Visual Studio Installer\". Instalasi bisa memakan waktu 10-30 menit.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

